    "name": "52Hertz",
    "steam_appid": 2964960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/a18ff8fe9af85f3e6716c9f8b73d1269.avif?t=1755006637\" width=772 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >52 Hertz is a <strong><i>narrative puzzle game</i></strong> set in a <strong><i>futuristic post-apocalyptic world.</i></strong> Trapped in a fog-shrouded, uncanny town, you must partner with the protagonist to solve murder cases and expose the killer. Through unraveling cryptic puzzles, you'll uncover your lost memories and the dark truths buried within this town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>52 Hertz: Hearing Your Call in the Frequency of Solitude.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eternally snowbound town. An inescapable time loop. A group of travelers trapped between memory and truth\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will embody Mo Shi, the amnesiac protagonist, stepping into this enigmatic town known as the &quot;Singularity.&quot; By unraveling a series of perplexing murder cases, you will gradually uncover the town\u2019s secrets, recover lost memories, and confront a long-buried past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember\u2014in this world, kindness can bring ruin, truth may cut deeper than lies, and a solitary call might just be the beginning of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you ready to listen to the sound of 52Hz?  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014In this world filled with mysteries and intertwined emotions, your choices will change everything.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/94e70bc7e7fca4cbc7cd3ffc0d4b139f.avif?t=1755006637\" width=772 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keyboard and mouse to control the character's movement, interactions, and puzzle-solving on a side-scrolling display. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/7b0401b027ea3b0945cdfba6b3f7be85.avif?t=1755006637\" width=772 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e5617328331dcce01a825023860ec77a.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e5617328331dcce01a825023860ec77a.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e5617328331dcce01a825023860ec77a.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fde537d3363e235f40a45082f1d1f088.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fde537d3363e235f40a45082f1d1f088.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fde537d3363e235f40a45082f1d1f088.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storyline Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a storyline with multiple branching options, allowing players to explore various endings flexibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Design</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's puzzles emphasize &quot;orthodox detection&quot; elements, designed based on the form of orthodox detection to create a classic plot structure akin to &quot;Ten Little Indians.&quot; They focus on clue collection and logical reasoning, enhancing the player's immersion and providing a direct experience of the pleasure of logical deduction while deeply engaging in the game's detective mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/44aa3667fb1d92ed6c9fa4b59e068f86.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/44aa3667fb1d92ed6c9fa4b59e068f86.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/44aa3667fb1d92ed6c9fa4b59e068f86.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes systems such as notes, inventory, clues, and maps that serve the plot and facilitate the narrative and deduction aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/876080b48517c4da03fe769323b1694b.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/876080b48517c4da03fe769323b1694b.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/876080b48517c4da03fe769323b1694b.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/7df7a9c3adc37632f0747a9ed07dfacb.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/7df7a9c3adc37632f0747a9ed07dfacb.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/7df7a9c3adc37632f0747a9ed07dfacb.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game employs a low saturation and washed-out style that combines 2D and 3D elements, creating a sense of subdued colors and fading tones. This visual approach conveys a tranquil yet melancholic atmosphere, offering a unique aesthetic experience within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fc465d97e5b367883e5efd21bf541f31.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fc465d97e5b367883e5efd21bf541f31.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/fc465d97e5b367883e5efd21bf541f31.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game music consists of original compositions by Evalia-\u7231\u5a03\u3001\u6c89\u6797\u5ddd\u3001\u9ed1\u91d1\u96e8, and more. The original soundtrack will be available for purchase at a later date.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/a18ff8fe9af85f3e6716c9f8b73d1269.avif?t=1755006637\" width=772 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >52 Hertz is a <strong><i>narrative puzzle game</i></strong> set in a <strong><i>futuristic post-apocalyptic world.</i></strong> Trapped in a fog-shrouded, uncanny town, you must partner with the protagonist to solve murder cases and expose the killer. Through unraveling cryptic puzzles, you'll uncover your lost memories and the dark truths buried within this town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>52 Hertz: Hearing Your Call in the Frequency of Solitude.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eternally snowbound town. An inescapable time loop. A group of travelers trapped between memory and truth\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will embody Mo Shi, the amnesiac protagonist, stepping into this enigmatic town known as the &quot;Singularity.&quot; By unraveling a series of perplexing murder cases, you will gradually uncover the town\u2019s secrets, recover lost memories, and confront a long-buried past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember\u2014in this world, kindness can bring ruin, truth may cut deeper than lies, and a solitary call might just be the beginning of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you ready to listen to the sound of 52Hz?  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014In this world filled with mysteries and intertwined emotions, your choices will change everything.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/94e70bc7e7fca4cbc7cd3ffc0