h\" >The game features a storyline with multiple branching options, allowing players to explore various endings flexibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/0215206ee820bc0abbb6cd500b40a4b7.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Design</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's puzzles emphasize &quot;orthodox detection&quot; elements, designed based on the form of orthodox detection to create a classic plot structure akin to &quot;Ten Little Indians.&quot; They focus on clue collection and logical reasoning, enhancing the player's immersion and providing a direct experience of the pleasure of logical deduction while deeply engaging in the game's detective mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.poster.avif?t=1755006637\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.webm?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964960/extras/e4fca25eec9b79939917860039f82068.mp4?t=1755006637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c